Arcade game architecture guidance:
- Responsive HTML5 <canvas> (e.g. 800x600 scaled with CSS aspect-ratio/object-fit) driven by requestAnimationFrame with a fixed 1/60 s timestep or clamped dt (<= 0.05 s).
- Express all speeds in px/s and cooldowns in seconds; use swept or sub-stepped collision for fast projectiles so bullets never tunnel.
- Support keyboard (WASD/Arrows + Space) with preventDefault() AND mouse/touch drag or on-screen action controls, plus P/Escape/blur pause and instant restart.
- Wrap localStorage high-score persistence in try/catch for sandboxed iframes, and use Web Audio API oscillators for laser, hit, explosion, pickup, and game-over SFX.
